    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine. Split. Promote.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>regular chess moves to merge two pieces</strong> onto the same square, creating a powerful hybrid. <strong>Move the combined piece using either piece\u2019s abilities</strong>, or<strong> split them apart</strong> later to individual pieces for strategic positioning when the time is right. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware, if the <strong>combined piece is captured, you'll lose both</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/e23148ade777314b98c4aa9d877f376b.poster.avif?t=1754975930\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/e23148ade777314b98c4aa9d877f376b.webm?t=1754975930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/e23148ade777314b98c4aa9d877f376b.mp4?t=1754975930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2654\u00a0<strong>Explore exponentially more strategies</strong> by <strong>combining\u00a0pieces</strong> into powerful hybrids or <strong>split</strong> them later for strategic positioning. <strong>Need more queens? Create your own</strong> with a &quot;Biook&quot; (Bishop + Rook) or rocket a pawn across the board with the &quot;Rawn&quot; (Rook + Pawn) for a quick promotion.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2654\u00a0<strong>Balanced Chess at its core</strong>, only regular legal moves apply. But be careful if your combined piece is captured - you'll lose them both!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2654 Show off your ELO ranking in PC / Mobile in <strong>cross-platform multiplayer</strong>\u00a0and make every move matter in a <strong>Roguelike adventure.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2654\u00a0<strong>Use traditional Chess moves to combine your pieces.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/82d4b5a6d353fe95a24ed1df70c42712.poster.avif?t=1754975930\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/82d4b5a6d353fe95a24ed1df70c42712.webm?t=1754975930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/82d4b5a6d353fe95a24ed1df70c42712.mp4?t=1754975930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2654\u00a0<strong>Combined pieces can move as either piece or even together.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/1053342e329914b96245dc8503a9059f.poster.avif?t=1754975930\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/1053342e329914b96245dc8503a9059f.webm?t=1754975930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/1053342e329914b96245dc8503a9059f.mp4?t=1754975930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2654\u00a0<strong>Unlock new strategies by splitting your pieces into their original forms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/680263d9ddd3b16a6e65ef068c83f6a1.poster.avif?t=1754975930\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/680263d9ddd3b16a6e65ef068c83f6a1.webm?t=1754975930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/680263d9ddd3b16a6e65ef068c83f6a1.mp4?t=1754975930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The <strong>officially</strong> <strong>licensed</strong> digital version of the Chessplus board game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This digital version of our Chessplus board game is a crafted with passion from our small team. Please reach out with thoughts, ideas and criticisms - we want to hear your feedback!</p>",
